ap:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Tennessee Guides: Property Tax, Probate, Foreclosure and Selling by City and County</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Tennessee</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Tennessee Guides: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Tennessee Guides sale</li><li>Turn the Tennessee Guides offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Sell Your Tennessee House for Cash</h2><p>Tell us about your Tennessee house.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>This is the full directory of our Tennessee guides.</strong></p><div class=\"wsp-related\"><h3>Statewide guides</h3><p><a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/shelby-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Shelby County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/knox-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Knox County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/blount-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Blount County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/sumner-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Sumner County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/sevier-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Sevier County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/bradley-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Bradley County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/hamilton-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Hamilton County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/putnam-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Putnam County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/anderson-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Anderson County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/mcminn-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">McMinn County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/robertson-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Robertson County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/williamson-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Williamson County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/bedford-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Bedford County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/cheatham-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Cheatham County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/cocke-county-tn-register-of-deeds/\">Cocke County, TN Register of Deeds Guide</a> <a href=\"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/davids